{%- comment -%}
  Standalone, crawlable "How it works" page. Previously every /pages/* URL
  on this theme rendered the identical full homepage SPA regardless of
  which page was visited — same body content on every URL, which is a
  content-duplication problem for search engines and means a visitor
  searching specifically for "how it works" landed on the full homepage,
  not focused content. This template gives that page its own real
  content, matching the copy already used in the homepage's #how section
  (kept in sync by hand — there are only two copies, homepage and this).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- render 'site-header' -%}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
  "itemListElement": [
    { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "MemoBrick", "item": {{ request.origin | append: '/' | json }} },
    { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "How it works", "item": {{ canonical_url | json }} }
  ]
}
</script>
<div class="wrap" style="padding:48px 20px 90px;max-width:820px">
  <p style="font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-3)">
    <a href="/" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:none">MemoBrick</a> <span aria-hidden="true">›</span> How it works
  </p>
  <h1 style="font-family:var(--display);font-size:34px;letter-spacing:-.03em;margin:10px 0 8px">Design it, order it, build it.</h1>
  <p style="color:var(--ink-2);font-size:16px;max-width:640px;margin:0 0 40px">
    You design it yourself in the free online Creator — no waiting on anyone. Prefer not to?
    Our designers will create it for you and send a proof before production.
  </p>

  <div style="display:grid;gap:32px">
    <article>
      <p style="font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--ink-3);margin:0 0 4px">STEP 01</p>
      <h2 style="font-family:var(--display);font-size:21px;margin:0 0 8px">Create your MemoBrick</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.6">Choose a favorite photo — family, pet, couple, or a memory you love.
        Upload it, crop it, choose your size, and adjust the filters until it looks just right. Prefer some
        help? Our artists can design it for you. You'll receive a digital preview before we ship, with free
        revisions until you love it.</p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <p style="font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--ink-3);margin:0 0 4px">STEP 02</p>
      <h2 style="font-family:var(--display);font-size:21px;margin:0 0 8px">We pack your DIY kit</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.6">Once your design is approved, we prepare your personalized kit
        with color-sorted bricks, easy step-by-step instructions, and everything you need to build.
        Carefully packed in our signature MemoBrick box and shipped from Miami, FL, usually within 2–4
        business days.</p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <p style="font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--ink-3);margin:0 0 4px">STEP 03</p>
      <h2 style="font-family:var(--display);font-size:21px;margin:0 0 8px">Build it and bring it to life</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.6">Follow your personalized guide and watch your photo come to
        life — brick by brick. It's relaxing, fun, and perfect to build alone or together. When you're done,
        frame it, hang it, or gift it — a one-of-a-kind piece of art made from a memory you love.</p>
    </article>
  </div>

  <p style="margin-top:48px">
    <a class="btn btn-red" href="/pages/editor">Start designing your MemoBrick</a>
  </p>
</div>

{%- render 'site-footer' -%}
